        <detaileddescription>
<para>Transform the loss distribution into the tranche loss distribution for losses L_T = min(L,D) - min(L,A). The effects are: 1) shift the distribution to the left by A, then 2) cut off at D-A, Pr(L_T &gt; D-A) = 0 3) ensure Pr(L_T &gt;= 0) = 1, i.e. a density spike at L_T = 0 </para>        </detaileddescription>
